      "mergeID": "5bdbc54ff26e555876cecc31",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Hello everyone!\n\nSo.. Yesterday I e-mailed VRChat's Hello Inbox about one thing, VRChat servers. We only have one and that is the problem, it is just not normal that Europeans have over 170 pings. It's just not okay, not to mention those people who are from even more different regions than America (for example Asia or Australia)!\n\n(I put the e-mail I wrote and what I got a response for.)\n\nSo please.. Everyone.. If we want to get better servers, please get this post an upvote. I know, all these posts about more servers doesn't get a lot of attention but I really want everyone to enjoy this game, so everyone can finally don't have to pause at every sentence because the other is speak but because of the 170 ping, they hear it too late, so everyone can play horror maps without latency.. It would be so much better, wouldn't it?\n\nThank you for reading this post and I hope I can count on everyone here.\nHave a really good day!",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Regional Servers",
